<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1097] IgniteFuture.chain() unwraps exceptions incorrectly.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1097</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Open class GridCacheAbstractFullApiSelfTest&lt;br/&gt;
2) Add the field: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;final&lt;/span&gt; CacheEntryProcessor&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; ERR_PROCESSOR =
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; CacheEntryProcessor&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;() {
            @Override &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; process(MutableEntry&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; e, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt;... args) {
                &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throw&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; RuntimeException(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Failed!&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
            }
        };
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3) Add the following test and observe that correct EntryProcessorException is thrown:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void testTransformException() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception {
    IgniteCache&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; cache = jcache().withAsync();
    cache.invoke(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;key2&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, ERR_PROCESSOR);
    cache.&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;future&lt;/span&gt;().get();
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;4) Modify the test as follows and observe that now incorrect RuntimeException is thrown and EntryProcessorException is lost:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void testTransformException() &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; Exception {
    IgniteCache&amp;lt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; cache = jcache().withAsync();
    cache.invoke(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;key2&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, ERR_PROCESSOR);
    IgniteFuture fut = cache.&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;future&lt;/span&gt;().chain(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; IgniteClosure&amp;lt;IgniteFuture, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;() {
        @Override &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; apply(IgniteFuture o) {
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; o.get();
        }
    });

    fut.get();
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
